Date: Tue, 18 Aug 2026 08:51:47 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 63/67] Glint: palette treats scheme URLs (glint://, etc.) as
 URLs, not searches

The URL heuristic required a dot, so scheme-only inputs like
glint://update-restart were sent to the search engine.
